---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<!-- Author: OpenAI-Codex_Responsible: Modpack_Website. -->
<aside class="project-status-summary" lang="en" aria-label="Project status">
	<div class="page-wrap">
		<p><strong>15 modules at different stages; 20 replacement targets.</strong> Targets are intentions, not completed replacements. AI Gaming development is paused. Combined-mod compatibility and subscribed-game acceptance are not established.</p>
		<a href={base + 'wiki/project/status/'}>Module status and replacement targets (English)</a>
	</div>
</aside>

<style>
	.project-status-summary { padding: 20px var(--margin); border-block: 1px solid var(--field); }
	p { max-width: 85ch; font-size: 15px; }
	a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; margin-top: 8px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>
